      "versionNonce": 1171372695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772352635403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "max_step = 4 时的批量数；\n最后【至少】留 4 个空格，\n因为每个批量都要做 max_step 个预测，\n留 max_step 个空格便于评估预测结果！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "max_step = 4 时的批量数；\n最后【至少】留 4 个空格，\n因为每个批量都要做 max_step 个预测，\n留 max_step 个空格便于评估预测结果！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
